<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ระบบจองคิวรถตรวจสุขภาพ - บริษัท เพรซิเดนท์ เบเกอรี่ จำกัด (มหาชน)</title>
  <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <!-- SweetAlert2 -->
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/sweetalert2@11"></script>
  <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  <!-- Google Fonts Prompt -->
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Prompt:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          fontFamily: {
            sans: ['Prompt', 'sans-serif'],
          },
          colors: {
            pb: {
              red: '#DA251D',
              darkred: '#A8140E',
              lightred: '#FFF1F0',
              gold: '#D4AF37',
              dark: '#1E293B',
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  </script>
  
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Prompt', sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fafc 0%, #e2e8f0 100%);
    }
    .glass-card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    }
    .header-gradient {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #DA251D 0%, #991B1B 60%, #701A1A 100%);
    }
    .custom-radio:checked + .radio-tile {
      border-color: #DA251D;
      background-color: #FFF1F0;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px 0 rgba(218, 37, 29, 0.25);
    }
    .custom-radio:checked + .radio-tile .icon-box {
      background-color: #DA251D;
      color: white;
    }
    .custom-radio:checked + .radio-tile .radio-dot {
      border-color: #DA251D;
      background-color: #DA251D;
    }
    .ticket-pattern {
      background-image: radial-gradient(#DA251D 0.75px, transparent 0.75px);
      background-size: 8px 8px;
    }
    .step-panel {
      animation: stepFadeIn 0.3s ease;
    }
    @keyframes stepFadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen py-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col justify-center items-center relative overflow-x-hidden">

  <!-- Background decorative elements -->
  <div class="fixed -top-24 -left-24 w-96 h-96 bg-red-200 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-40 pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="fixed -bottom-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 bg-amber-100 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-50 pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="w-full max-w-5xl z-10">
    
    <!-- Top Brand Header Bar -->
    <div class="header-gradient text-white rounded-t-3xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden relative p-6 sm:p-8 border-b-4 border-pb-gold">
      <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 opacity-10 text-9xl pointer-events-none">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-bus-simple"></i>
      </div>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-4 relative z-10">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/15 backdrop-blur-md px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-amber-200 mb-2 border border-white/20">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-crown text-pb-gold"></i> ระดับตำแหน่งหัวหน้าแผนกขึ้นไป
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white flex items-center gap-3">
            <span>ระบบจองคิวรถตรวจสุขภาพประจำปี 2569</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-red-100 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-1 font-light flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-regular fa-building"></i> บริษัท เพรซิเดนท์ เบเกอรี่ จำกัด (มหาชน)
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-black/20 p-3 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm self-start md:self-auto">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white/20 flex items-center justify-center text-xl text-amber-300">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-clock-rotate-left"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs">
            <div class="text-red-200 font-light">เวลาออกเดินทาง</div>
            <div class="text-base font-bold text-white tracking-wider">08:00 น. ตรง</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content Container -->
    <div class="glass-card rounded-b-3xl shadow-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 border-t-0">

      <!-- Search & Status Section -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-50 to-red-50/40 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-red-100 mb-8 shadow-sm">
        <label for="searchEmpId" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-pb-red mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass"></i> ค้นหาข้อมูลจองคิวที่มีอยู่ / ตรวจสอบสิทธิ์
        </label>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <div class="relative flex-grow">
            <div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 pl-3.5 flex items-center pointer-events-none text-slate-400">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-id-card"></i>
            </div>
            <input type="text" id="searchEmpId" placeholder="กรอกรหัสพนักงาน เช่น 10485" class="w-full pl-10 pr-4 py-3 bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-pb-red focus:border-pb-red text-slate-800 text-sm font-medium shadow-sm transition">
          </div>
          <button type="button" onclick="searchBooking()" class="bg-pb-red hover:bg-pb-darkred active:scale-95 text-white font-semibold py-3 px-6 rounded-xl shadow-md transition-all duration-200 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm whitespace-nowrap">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass"></i> ค้นหาข้อมูล
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Admin Access Bar -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6 -mt-2 px-1">
        <div id="adminStatusBar" class="hidden inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-800 text-white text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield text-amber-300"></i> โหมดผู้ดูแลระบบ
          <button type="button" onclick="adminLogout()" class="ml-1 text-slate-300 hover:text-white underline underline-offset-2">ออกจากระบบ</button>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-grow"></div>
        <button type="button" id="btnAdminLogin" onclick="openAdminLogin()" class="text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-pb-red font-medium flex items-center gap-1.5 transition">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield"></i> สำหรับผู้ดูแลระบบ
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Step Indicator -->
      <div class="mb-8 px-1" id="wizardTop">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1" data-step-indicator="1">
            <div class="step-circle w-9 h-9 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold bg-pb-red text-white transition-colors">1</div>
            <div class="step-label text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-pb-red mt-1.5 text-center">ข้อมูลพนักงาน</div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-connector flex-1 h-1 mx-1 sm:mx-2 rounded bg-slate-200 transition-colors"></div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1" data-step-indicator="2">
            <div class="step-circle w-9 h-9 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold bg-slate-200 text-slate-500 transition-colors">2</div>
            <div class="step-label text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 mt-1.5 text-center">จุดขึ้นรถ</div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-connector flex-1 h-1 mx-1 sm:mx-2 rounded bg-slate-200 transition-colors"></div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1" data-step-indicator="3">
            <div class="step-circle w-9 h-9 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold bg-slate-200 text-slate-500 transition-colors">3</div>
            <div class="step-label text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 mt-1.5 text-center">วันเดินทาง</div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-connector flex-1 h-1 mx-1 sm:mx-2 rounded bg-slate-200 transition-colors"></div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1" data-step-indicator="4">
            <div class="step-circle w-9 h-9 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold bg-slate-200 text-slate-500 transition-colors">4</div>
            <div class="step-label text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 mt-1.5 text-center">ตรวจสอบ/ยืนยัน</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <form id="bookingForm" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();" class="space-y-8">

        <!-- Grid Layout: Form Inputs + Live E-Ticket Preview -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8">
          
          <!-- Left Column: Form Fields (8 cols) -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
            
            <!-- Section 1: Employee Info -->
            <div id="step1" class="step-panel">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-slate-200">
                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-pb-red text-white font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center">1</span>
                <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800">ข้อมูลผู้ลงทะเบียน</h2>
              </div>

              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                <div>
                  <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 mb-1">รหัสพนักงาน <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                  <input type="text" id="empId" name="empId" required oninput="updateTicketPreview()" class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-pb-red text-sm transition">
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 mb-1">ชื่อ - สกุล <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                  <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required oninput="updateTicketPreview()" class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-pb-red text-sm transition">
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 mb-1">ตำแหน่ง <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                  <input type="text" id="position" name="position" required oninput="updateTicketPreview()" class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-pb-red text-sm transition">
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 mb-1">ฝ่าย <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                  <input type="text" id="department" name="department" required oninput="updateTicketPreview()" class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-pb-red text-sm transition">
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 mb-1">ส่วน <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                  <input type="text" id="division" name="division" required class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-pb-red text-sm transition">
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 mb-1">แผนก <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                  <input type="text" id="section" name="section" required class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-pb-red text-sm transition">
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Section 2: Location Selection -->
            <div id="step2" class="step-panel hidden">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-slate-200">
                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-pb-red text-white font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center">2</span>
                <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800">สถานที่ขึ้นรถ (เวลารถออก 08:00 น.)</h2>
              </div>

              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3">
                
                <label class="cursor-pointer relative">
                  <input type="radio" name="location" value="โรงงานลาดกระบัง 1 (หน้าอาคาร 3)" required onchange="updateTicketPreview()" class="custom-radio sr-only">
                  <div class="radio-tile flex items-center p-4 border-2 border-slate-200 rounded-xl transition-all duration-200 hover:border-red-300 hover:bg-slate-50">
                    <div class="icon-box w-11 h-11 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 flex items-center justify-center text-lg mr-4 transition-colors">
                      <i class="fa-solid fa-industry"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex-grow">
                      <div class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm">โรงงานลาดกระบัง 1</div>
                      <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">จุดจอด: จุดหน้าอาคาร 3</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="radio-dot w-5 h-5 rounded-full border-2 border-slate-300 flex items-center justify-center">
                      <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white"></div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </label>

                <label class="cursor-pointer relative">
                  <input type="radio" name="location" value="โรงงานบางชัน (หน้าประชาสัมพันธ์)" required onchange="updateTicketPreview()" class="custom-radio sr-only">
                  <div class="radio-tile flex items-center p-4 border-2 border-slate-200 rounded-xl transition-all duration-200 hover:border-red-300 hover:bg-slate-50">
                    <div class="icon-box w-11 h-11 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 flex items-center justify-center text-lg mr-4 transition-colors">
                      <i class="fa-solid fa-building-user"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex-grow">
                      <div class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm">โรงงานบางชัน</div>
                      <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">จุดจอด: หน้าเคาน์เตอร์ประชาสัมพันธ์</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="radio-dot w-5 h-5 rounded-full border-2 border-slate-300 flex items-center justify-center">
                      <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white"></div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </label>

              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Section 3: Date Selection -->
            <div id="step3" class="step-panel hidden">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-slate-200">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-pb-red text-white font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
                  <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800">เลือกวันที่เดินทางไปตรวจสุขภาพ</h2>
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs text-amber-600 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full flex items-center gap-1 font-medium">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i> แก้ไขได้ล่วงหน้า 2 วัน
                </span>
              </div>

              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                
                <label class="cursor-pointer relative" data-date-tile="24 กันยายน 2569">
                  <input type="radio" name="date" value="24 กันยายน 2569" required onchange="updateTicketPreview()" class="custom-radio sr-only">
                  <div class="radio-tile p-3.5 border-2 border-slate-200 rounded-xl transition-all text-center hover:border-red-300">
                    <div class="icon-box w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 mx-auto mb-2 flex items-center justify-center text-sm">
                      <i class="fa-regular fa-calendar-check"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm">24 ก.ย. 2569</div>
                    <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">วันพุธ</div>
                    <div class="seat-info text-[10px] font-semibold mt-1 text-slate-400">กำลังโหลด...</div>
                  </div>
                </label>

                <label class="cursor-pointer relative" data-date-tile="1 ตุลาคม 2569">
                  <input type="radio" name="date" value="1 ตุลาคม 2569" required onchange="updateTicketPreview()" class="custom-radio sr-only">
                  <div class="radio-tile p-3.5 border-2 border-slate-200 rounded-xl transition-all text-center hover:border-red-300">
                    <div class="icon-box w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 mx-auto mb-2 flex items-center justify-center text-sm">
                      <i class="fa-regular fa-calendar-check"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm">1 ต.ค. 2569</div>
                    <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">วันพฤหัสบดี</div>
                    <div class="seat-info text-[10px] font-semibold mt-1 text-slate-400">กำลังโหลด...</div>
                  </div>
                </label>

                <label class="cursor-pointer relative" data-date-tile="8 ตุลาคม 2569">
                  <input type="radio" name="date" value="8 ตุลาคม 2569" required onchange="updateTicketPreview()" class="custom-radio sr-only">
                  <div class="radio-tile p-3.5 border-2 border-slate-200 rounded-xl transition-all text-center hover:border-red-300">
                    <div class="icon-box w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 mx-auto mb-2 flex items-center justify-center text-sm">
                      <i class="fa-regular fa-calendar-check"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm">8 ต.ค. 2569</div>
                    <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">วันพฤหัสบดี</div>
                    <div class="seat-info text-[10px] font-semibold mt-1 text-slate-400">กำลังโหลด...</div>
                  </div>
                </label>

                <label class="cursor-pointer relative" data-date-tile="15 ตุลาคม 2569">
                  <input type="radio" name="date" value="15 ตุลาคม 2569" required onchange="updateTicketPreview()" class="custom-radio sr-only">
                  <div class="radio-tile p-3.5 border-2 border-slate-200 rounded-xl transition-all text-center hover:border-red-300">
                    <div class="icon-box w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 mx-auto mb-2 flex items-center justify-center text-sm">
                      <i class="fa-regular fa-calendar-check"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm">15 ต.ค. 2569</div>
                    <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">วันพฤหัสบดี</div>
                    <div class="seat-info text-[10px] font-semibold mt-1 text-slate-400">กำลังโหลด...</div>
                  </div>
                </label>

              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Section 4: Review & Confirm -->
            <div id="step4" class="step-panel hidden">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-slate-200">
                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-pb-red text-white font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center">4</span>
                <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800">ตรวจสอบข้อมูลก่อนยืนยัน</h2>
              </div>

              <div class="space-y-3 text-sm">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-start gap-3 p-3.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
                  <div class="min-w-0">
                    <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 uppercase font-semibold tracking-wide">ข้อมูลผู้ลงทะเบียน</div>
                    <div id="reviewEmpInfo" class="font-semibold text-slate-800 mt-0.5">-</div>
                  </div>
                  <button type="button" onclick="goToStep(1, { skipValidation: true })" class="flex-shrink-0 text-xs text-pb-red font-semibold hover:underline flex items-center gap-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-pen"></i> แก้ไข</button>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-start gap-3 p-3.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
                  <div class="min-w-0">
                    <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 uppercase font-semibold tracking-wide">จุดขึ้นรถ</div>
                    <div id="reviewLocation" class="font-semibold text-slate-800 mt-0.5">-</div>
                  </div>
                  <button type="button" onclick="goToStep(2, { skipValidation: true })" class="flex-shrink-0 text-xs text-pb-red font-semibold hover:underline flex items-center gap-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-pen"></i> แก้ไข</button>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-start gap-3 p-3.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
                  <div class="min-w-0">
                    <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 uppercase font-semibold tracking-wide">วันที่เดินทาง</div>
                    <div id="reviewDate" class="font-semibold text-pb-red mt-0.5">-</div>
                  </div>
                  <button type="button" onclick="goToStep(3, { skipValidation: true })" class="flex-shrink-0 text-xs text-pb-red font-semibold hover:underline flex items-center gap-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-pen"></i> แก้ไข</button>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-4 text-[11px] text-slate-400 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-100 text-amber-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 flex items-start gap-2">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info mt-0.5"></i>
                <span>กรุณาตรวจสอบข้อมูลให้ถูกต้อง เมื่อกดยืนยันแล้วระบบจะบันทึกข้อมูลของท่านเข้าสู่ฐานข้อมูลทันที</span>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- Right Column: Interactive Live Ticket Preview (5 cols) -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-start">
